# Frontend Agent

I own `src/components/**`, `src/app/**`, `src/styles/**`, and
`src/lib/client/**`. I consume the design system at
`docs/design-system.md` (do not edit it — see the design-aware skill
and ADR-009). UI changes ship behind feature flags when they touch
revenue-critical surfaces.
